 "SegmentationResolution"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "3eac9f55-9b44-2143-b461-1337f6475981"],
 "\[LineSeparator]is an option for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["SegmentData",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:QMRITools/ref/SegmentData"]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"12338184-9ff6-5849-be99-a64177c65eab"],
 ". If specified it allows to rescale the data before its processed by the \
segmentation network. It can be {voxData, voxSegment} or {dimension} which \
are the same inputs as for the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["RescaleData",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:QMRITools/ref/RescaleData"]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"0b813fd5-4007-2840-80d1-9a25dc61497a"],
 " function which is used internally."
}], "Usage",
 CellID->261858818,ExpressionUUID->"cdab2297-d806-bf4c-8726-c83fba030552"],

